<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>제출 승인 | ARK PROJECT</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root { --gold:#D4AF37; --gold-soft:#E8D9A0; --line:rgba(212,175,55,0.22); }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
    body { font-family:'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Apple SD Gothic Neo',sans-serif; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1A3620,#0E1F12); color:#FBF8F0; min-height:100vh; padding:26px 14px 60px; }
    h1 { font-size:19px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px; }
    .desc { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--gold-soft); opacity:0.85; margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.8; }
    .err { margin-bottom:14px; padding:12px 15px; border-radius:10px; font-size:13.5px; background:rgba(180,50,50,0.18); border:1px solid rgba(220,100,100,0.5); color:#ffd9d9; }
    .s { display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.24); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .s .thumb { width:62px; height:62px; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; background:#06130a; border:1px solid var(--line); flex-shrink:0; }
    .s .thumb img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
    .s .num { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; letter-spacing:0.5px; }
    .s .meta { font-size:12px; color:var(--gold-soft); margin-top:5px; line-height:1.7; }
    .s .tab { font-size:10.5px; color:var(--gold); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4); border-radius:10px; padding:2px 9px; margin-left:8px; }
    .s .acts { margin-left:auto; display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .s .acts a { text-decoration:none; font-size:12.5px; padding:9px 14px; border-radius:9px; }
    .s .acts .photo { border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.45); color:var(--gold-soft); }
    .s .acts .go { background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E6C75A,#D4AF37); color:#10220f; font-weight:700; }
    .empty { text-align:center; padding:36px 0; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--gold-soft); opacity:0.8; }
    .wrap { max-width:1100px !important; margin:0 auto; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <%- include('partials/nav', { active: 'submissions', grades: grades }) %>
    <h1>정품 등록 제출 승인</h1>
    <div class="desc">
      손님이 제출한 '확인대기' 건들입니다. ① 사진으로 개체·라벨 실물 확인 → ② [승인·보증서 발급] 버튼을 누르면
      등록 화면이 넘버·구매자·연락처가 채워진 채 열립니다 → ③ 등급 선택 후 등록하면 보증서가 자동 발송되고 상태가 '정품 인증'이 됩니다.
    </div>

    <% if (error) { %><div class="err">⚠️ <%= error %></div><% } %>

    <% subs.forEach(function (x) { %>
    <div class="s">
      <div class="thumb"><% if (x.사진) { %><a href="<%= x.사진 %>" target="_blank"><img src="<%= x.사진 %>" alt="" /></a><% } %></div>
      <div>
        <div class="num"><%= x.넘버 %><span class="tab"><%= x.탭 %></span></div>
        <div class="meta"><%= x.제출자명 %> · <%= x.연락처 %> · <%= x.제출일 %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acts">
        <% if (x.사진) { %><a class="photo" href="<%= x.사진 %>" target="_blank">사진 크게 보기</a><% } %>
        <a class="go" href="/admin/new?num=<%= encodeURIComponent(x.넘버) %>&owner=<%= encodeURIComponent(x.제출자명) %>&phone=<%= encodeURIComponent(x.연락처) %>">승인 · 보증서 발급 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <% }); %>
    <% if (!subs.length) { %><div class="empty">확인 대기 중인 제출이 없습니다. ✦</div><% } %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
